                "text": "There are 27,000 children on NJ FamilyCare in Congressman Tom Kean\u2019s district. \nThis year, I spoke to some of his residents because he refuses to.\nHere\u2019s the message from one of his constituents who fears what will happen to her family if Rep. Kean votes to cut Medicaid aka NJ FamilyCare",
