                "retweet_count": 73,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Rep. Van Drew has 176,000 constituents in Medicaid including 82,000 children and 17,000 seniors. I wonder what they think about this.\nWait. I don\u2019t have to wonder. I went and spoke to them earlier this year. \nThey\u2019re furious.",
