                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "These trends can be reversed, aided by solid support systems and access to healthcare and community resources. \n\nMany young people will need comprehensive mental health care to heal - but that will be an uphill battle when programs and funding for mental health are being cut.\n\nhttps://t.co/t3Qq68NF64",
